lassName\":\"blog-text-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"81e7c2abff51\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 mt-10 font-secondary text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-2px] text-ivory \",\"children\":[\"A Milestone for Grove and for DeFi\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"af6472f50b98\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"The Sky ecosystem was founded on a vision of radically transparent, decentralized capital formation. With USDS adoption broadening and the ecosystem’s balance sheet steadily expanding, Grove now marks a pivotal step forward: moving from tokenized cash-equivalents into scalable, yield-generating credit.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"08eab6dc5d20\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Grove’s initial deployment into the Janus Henderson Anemoy JAAA Fund, a fully tokenized portfolio of AAA-rated CLOs, is not just a diversification play. It represents a milestone for DeFi itself, a meaningful, onchain allocation into one of the most resilient and popular institutional-grade credit products in the market.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"5f53d2ceb6a8\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 mt-10 font-secondary text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-2px] text-ivory \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0edd6f9dcf6c\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-ivory\",\"children\":[\"Why CLOs Belong Onchain\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8e5f869b5541\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Collateralized Loan Obligations have quietly become one of the most important engines of credit formation in traditional finance. Backed by portfolios of senior secured corporate loans (typically 200 to 300 names per deal), CLOs are structured with robust protections and have weathered multiple market cycles with extraordinary resilience.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"eb5907a0073d\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"For capital allocators in the crypto economy, the appeal is clear:\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0d9cceabe361-parent\",{\"className\":\"mb-8 ml-8 list-disc list-outside space-y-4 pl-2 text-ivory/90 [\u0026_ul]:ml-6 [\u0026_ul]:list-[circle]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0d9cceabe361\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Floating-rate structure protects against interest rate risk.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"fddf89e616af\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"CLOs historically offer a yield pickup of 100–150 basis points over treasuries.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"541edb08fffd\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Scale and liquidity rival many sovereign bond markets.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"f6cf2d91a026\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Credit enhancement and subordination provide meaningful protection for senior tranches.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"7aed8acf77ae\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Structural protections like overcollateralization tests divert cashflows to further protect senior bonds.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"49daf06114ec\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"At the top of the CLO capital stack are the AAA tranches, protected by 35–40% subordination and subject to strict overcollateralization and interest coverage tests. These protections have worked: no AAA or AA CLO tranche has ever defaulted, including through the Global Financial Crisis and COVID. In fact, there have been no principal impairments in CLO tranches rated BBB or higher issued since 2012 (CLO ratings got even more conservative after the 2008 crisis).\"]}],\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\",\"$L32\",\"$L33\",\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\",\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\",\"$L3d\",\"$L3e\",\"$L3f\",\"$L40\",\"$L41\",\"$L42\",\"$L43\",\"$L44\",\"$L45\",\"$L46\",\"$L47\"]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"delay\":0.15,\"children\":[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-ivory/20 pt-10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xqn42s6c/production/b0bc4622ba079364d90218eef2a5df063c9bf5a2-512x512.webp?w=128\u0026h=128\",\"alt\":\"Sam Paderewski\",\"width\":64,\"height\":64,\"className\":\"rounded-full object-cover\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[18px] font-medium text-ivory\",\"children\":\"Sam Paderewski\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-[14px] text-ivory/60\",\"children\":\"Co-Founder, Structured finance and credit\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://x.com/0x_roo\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"aria-label\":\"X (Twitter) profile\",\"className\":\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ivory/10 text-ivory transition-colors hover:bg-yellow hover:text-charcoal\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"width\":\"14\",\"height\":\"14\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sam-paderewski-17027129\",\"target\":\"_blan