Find actionable insights designed for institutions, protocols, and power users looking to stay ahead in decentralized finance. Fresh thinking. Straight from the Grove.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L49\",null,{\"inputId\":\"blog-detail-subscribe-email\",\"successMode\":\"panel\",\"className\":\"mx-auto mt-8 w-full max-w-[480px]\"}]]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"21919a3599db\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Despite this track record, CLOs are often misunderstood, especially in crypto circles. They are not the same as the CDOs that fueled the 2008 crisis. CLOs do not securitize subprime mortgages, but rather are actively managed portfolios of secured loans to established U.S. businesses. They’re governed by strict reinvestment rules and performance covenants, with built-in safeguards that trigger deleveraging if asset quality deteriorates.\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",\"dc5d4e4c0530\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"The market speaks for itself:\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1a533de31c69-parent\",{\"className\":\"mb-8 ml-8 list-disc list-outside space-y-4 pl-2 text-ivory/90 [\u0026_ul]:ml-6 [\u0026_ul]:list-[circle]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"1a533de31c69\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"$$1+ trillion in US CLOs outstanding; ~$1.4 trillion globally.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"9bcb2a8659b4\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"2024 set a new record for U.S. CLO issuance, with $190+ billion in new deals.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"6565e8a916ef\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Bid-ask spreads in secondary markets remain tight, reflecting strong liquidity and dealer support.\"]}]]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"05dc7c84e9ab\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"For DeFi protocols and crypto-native organizations seeking to put idle capital to work in scalable, high-quality yield without incurring directional crypto risk, AAA CLOs offer a uniquely compelling profile.\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"b69a98f28364\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 mt-10 font-secondary text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-2px] text-ivory \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"628ae0609bde\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-ivory\",\"children\":[\"JAAA as a Breakthrough Product\"]}]]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",\"cce95076218e\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Grove’s first major deployment is a $1 billion allocation into the Janus Henderson Anemoy JAAA Fund, a fully tokenized vehicle that holds only AAA-rated CLO tranches.\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"930dabba0faa\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"JAAA was built by Janus Henderson, a global asset manager with $450+ billion under management, Anemoy, a credit structuring specialist; and Centrifuge, the DeFi-native RWA platform that pioneered tokenized invoice and credit finance.\"]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"a4e3ef18dd1c\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"In 2020, Janus Henderson launched the JAAA ETF on traditional exchanges, the first actively managed fund focused solely on AAA-rated CLO tranches. At the time, many in the market doubted that a CLO ETF could succeed: CLOs traded over-the-counter, were seen as structurally complex, and were thought to be too opaque or illiquid for the daily liquidity demands of an ETF. But Janus Henderson proved otherwise. By focusing exclusively on the most senior tranches and actively managing the portfolio with institutional rigor, the JAAA ETF grew to over $20 billion in assets by early 2025, becoming one of the biggest stories in fixed income.\"]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",\"326f9f7ff3b8\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"This is not a synthetic or wrapped asset. It is real exposure to the top of the CLO capital stack, represented by onchain tokens that inherit the economic rights of fully compliant, real-world securities.\"]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"p\",\"d84c99856c0"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"For Grove, this is the perfect starting point: a high-quality, liquid, low-volatility asset that demonstrates the viability of large-scale DeFi-to-TradFi capital flows. It sets a precedent not just for what DeFi protocols can own, but how they can own it, and how they can do so with regulatory and institutional clarity.\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"f540fb265040\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 mt-10 font-secondary text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-2px] text-ivory \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"99dfdea2d6f4\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-ivory\",\"children\":[\"Grove’s Role in Scaling Real-World Credit\"]}]]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4aaa585a4df7\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Grove was designed to be Sky’s institutional-grade credit engine: an autonomous vehicle for deploying capital into real-world yield opportunities while preserving the transparency and efficiency of onchain infrastructure.\"]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"43637f5bafe9\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Until now, most DeFi lending has been either overcollateralized crypto-to-crypto loans or passive exposure to tokenized T-Bills. While both serve important purposes, they are capital-inefficient and offer limited upside. Tokenized treasuries provide a secure foundation, but aren’t sufficient to consistently support long term onchain savings or DAO operations at scale.\"]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"be80ea39eca7\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"That’s where Grove comes in. It extends the Sky ecosystem’s real-world asset strategy into a broader credit universe, targeting assets with higher yield, deeper credit markets, and more flexible risk-reward tradeoffs. Grove operates with its own first-loss capital and governance architecture, minimizing coordination overhead while preserving alignment with Sky’s core parameters.\"]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"c888b6a0b673\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"The vision is simple but powerful:\"]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"b3121c1c9d23-parent\",{\"className\":\"mb-8 ml-8 list-disc list-outside space-y-4 pl-2 text-ivory/90 [\u0026_ul]:ml-6 [\u0026_ul]:list-[circle]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"b3121c1c9d23\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Scalable credit creation across onchain and offchain markets.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"cb6c1c6180da\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Streamlined governance and internal capital buffers that enable independent allocation decisions.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2d4c5a0eb120\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Programmatic yield routing to support Sky’s balance sheet and USDS holders.\"]}]]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"a4765976d681\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Grove doesn’t just move capital, it moves it intelligently, with real underwriting standards, institutional partnerships, and autonomy to adapt to market conditions.\"]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"9f812e746d0e\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 mt-10 font-secondary text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-2px] text-ivory \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"bff70e89f249\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-ivory\",\"children\":[\"The Next Chapter in DeFi\"]}]]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4c3eb25633d5\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Crypto has long promised a more open, efficient, and fair financial system. But without access to real-world, risk-adjusted yield, that system remains incomplete. High-quality tokenized credit solves f"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"or one of DeFi’s central challenges: the ability to generate sustainable, stable returns for onchain savers and treasuries without relying on speculation or unsustainable emissions.\"]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"p\",\"bd5ee16fc079\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"By importing low-volatility, uncorrelated credit assets like AAA CLOs, Grove creates a stronger foundation for DeFi:\"]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"8327f9105c05-parent\",{\"className\":\"mb-8 ml-8 list-disc list-outside space-y-4 pl-2 text-ivory/90 [\u0026_ul]:ml-6 [\u0026_ul]:list-[circle]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"8327f9105c05\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"DAOs, stablecoins, and synthetic dollar products gain access to resilient income streams.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"c19ba6f4e3cf\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Savings products can offer more consistent yields, even during crypto bear markets.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"a38b414db51d\",{\"className\":\"pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"Onchain capital can compete with traditional financial returns, while retaining programmability and composability.\"]}]]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4e28994a65f9\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"This isn’t about financial engineering for its own sake. It’s about building a new architecture where crypto-exogenous credit can help power an onchain economy, efficiently, transparently, and at scale.\"]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"p\",\"01e213f31afb\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"As Grove scales, we expect new classes of credit to follow: syndicated loans, trade finance, asset-based lending, and more. Each integration brings more opportunity for users, more sustainability for protocols, and more legitimacy for DeFi as an alternative financial system. This is how DeFi grows up, not by mimicking TradFi, but by integrating its strongest features into a better, more open system.\"]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",\"f100658cf594\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"To explore integration opportunities or learn more about Grove’s credit infrastructure, visit grove.finance.\"]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"p\",\"b49804596442\",{\"className\":\"mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]\",\"children\":[\"We are actively hiring across several key areas, including engineering, credit, risk, and protocol operations. To learn more or express interest, check out grove.finance/careers.\"]}]\n"])</script><div hidden id="S:3"><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="flex flex-1 flex-col"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://grove.finance/blog/unlocking-onchain-credit-grove-s-usd1b-deployment-into-tokenized-clos"},"headline":"Unlocking Onchain Credit: Grove’s $1B Deployment into Tokenized CLOs","image":["https://cdn.sanity.io/images/xqn42s6c/production/e2fc802c38004b90b639a0063db920a8e4cac6da-716x560.jpg?rect=0,92,716,376&w=1200&h=630"],"datePublished":"2025-08-06T16:58:00.000Z","dateModified":"2025-08-06T16:58:00.000Z","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sam Paderewski"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Grove Protocol","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://grove.finance/android-chrome-512x512.png"}},"articleSection":"Operations"}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://grove.finance"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Blog","item":"https://grove.finance/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Unlocking Onchain Credit: Grove’s $1B Deployment into Tokenized CLOs","item":"https://grove.finance/blog/unlocking-onchain-credit-grove-s-usd1b-deployment-into-tokenized-clos"}]}</script><article class="site-wrapper py-12 md:py-20"><div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] lg:gap-8"><div class="hidden lg:block lg:self-start"><aside aria-label="Article details"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-[120px]"><div class="flex flex-row gap-6 lg:flex-col lg:gap-0"><div class="lg:mb-4"><div class="grove-eyebrow text-ivory/50">Published</div><time dateTime="2025-08-06T16:58:00.000Z" class="mt-1 block font-secondary text-[14px] font-medium italic text-ivory/80">August 6, 2025</time></div><div><div class="grove-eyebrow text-ivory/50">Reading time</div><div class="mt-1 font-secondary text-[14px] font-medium italic text-ivory/80">7<!-- --> min read</div></div></div></div></aside></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="mb-4 lg:hidden" aria-label="Article metadata"><span class="font-secondary text-[12px] italic text-ivory/60">August 6, 2025</span><span class="mx-2 text-[12px] text-ivory/60">·</span><span class="font-secondary text-[12px] italic text-ivory/60">7<!-- --> min read</span></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)"><header class="mb-8"><div class="mb-6"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-grove-pill border border-ivory/25 bg-charcoal/22 px-3 py-1 backdrop-blur-grove-pill"><span class="font-secondary text-[12px] font-medium italic leading-[1.4] text-ivory">Operations</span></span></div><h1 class="font-secondary text-[32px] leading-[1.15] font-medium tracking-[-1.5px] text-ivory md:text-[45px] md:leading-[1.15] md:tracking-[-2px]">Unlocking Onchain Credit: Grove’s $1B Deployment into Tokenized CLOs</h1><div class="mt-4 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ivory/75 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]"><p class="mb-2 last:mb-0">A meaningful, onchain allocation into one of the most resilient and popular institutional-grade credit products in the market.</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3"><img alt="Sam Paderewski" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fxqn42s6c%2Fproduction%2Fb0bc4622ba079364d90218eef2a5df063c9bf5a2-512x512.webp%3Fw%3D96%26h%3D96&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fxqn42s6c%2Fproduction%2Fb0bc4622ba079364d90218eef2a5df063c9bf5a2-512x512.webp%3Fw%3D96%26h%3D96&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fxqn42s6c%2Fproduction%2Fb0bc4622ba079364d90218eef2a5df063c9bf5a2-512x512.webp%3Fw%3D96%26h%3D96&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div><div class="text-[14px] font-medium text-ivory">Sam Paderewski</div><div class="text-[12px] text-ivory/60">Co-Founder, Structured finance and credit</div></div></div></header></div><hr class="my-10 border-ivory/20"/><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)"><div class="blog-content"><div class="blog-text-section"><h2 class="mb-6 mt-10 font-secondary text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-2px] text-ivory ">A Milestone for Grove and for DeFi</h2><p class="mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">The Sky ecosystem was founded on a vision of radically transparent, decentralized capital formation. With USDS adoption broadening and the ecosystem’s balance sheet steadily expanding, Grove now marks a pivotal step forward: moving from tokenized cash-equivalents into scalable, yield-generating credit.</p><p class="mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">Grove’s initial deployment into the Janus Henderson Anemoy JAAA Fund, a fully tokenized portfolio of AAA-rated CLOs, is not just a diversification play. It represents a milestone for DeFi itself, a meaningful, onchain allocation into one of the most resilient and popular institutional-grade credit products in the market.</p><h2 class="mb-6 mt-10 font-secondary text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-2px] text-ivory "><strong class="font-bold text-ivory">Why CLOs Belong Onchain</strong></h2><p class="mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">Collateralized Loan Obligations have quietly become one of the most important engines of credit formation in traditional finance. Backed by portfolios of senior secured corporate loans (typically 200 to 300 names per deal), CLOs are structured with robust protections and have weathered multiple market cycles with extraordinary resilience.</p><p class="mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">For capital allocators in the crypto economy, the appeal is clear:</p><ul class="mb-8 ml-8 list-disc list-outside space-y-4 pl-2 text-ivory/90 [&amp;_ul]:ml-6 [&amp;_ul]:list-[circle]"><li class="pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">Floating-rate structure protects against interest rate risk.</li><li class="pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">CLOs historically offer a yield pickup of 100–150 basis points over treasuries.</li><li class="pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">Scale and liquidity rival many sovereign bond markets.</li><li class="pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">Credit enhancement and subordination provide meaningful protection for senior tranches.</li><li class="pl-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">Structural protections like overcollateralization tests divert cashflows to further protect senior bonds.</li></ul><p class="mb-6 text-[16px] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.4507px] text-ivory/90 md:text-[18px] md:leading-[31px]">At the top of the CLO capital stack are the AAA tranches, protected by 35–40% subordination and subject to strict overcollateralization and interest coverage tests. These protections have worked: no AAA or AA CLO tranche has ever defaulted, including through the Global Financial Crisis and COVID. In fact, there have been no principal impairments in CLO tranches rated BBB or higher issued since 2012 (CLO ratings got even more conservative after the 2008 crisis).</p><template id="P:5"></template><template id="P:6"></template><template id="P:7"></template><template id="P:8"></template><template id="P:9"></template><template id="P:a"></template><template id="P:b"></template><template id="P:c"></template><template id="P:d"></template><template id="P:e"></template><template id="P:f"></template><template id="P:10"></template><template id="P:11"></template><template id="P:12"></template><template id="P:13"></template><template id="P:14"></template><template id="P:15"></template><template id="P:16"></template><template id="P:17"></template><template id="P:18"></template><template id="P:19"></template><template id="P:1a"></template><template id="P:1b"></template><template id="P:1c"></template><template id="P:1d"></template></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)"><footer class="mt-16 border-t border-ivory/20 pt-10"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><img alt="Sam Paderewski" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fxqn42s6c%2Fproduction%2Fb0bc4622ba079364d90218eef2a5df063c9bf5a2-512x512.webp%3Fw%3D128%26h%3D128&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fxqn42s6c%2Fproduction%2Fb0bc4622ba079364d90218eef2a5df063c9bf5a2-512x512.webp%3Fw%3D128%26h%3D128&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fxqn42s6c%2Fproduction%2Fb0bc4622ba079364d90218eef2a5df063c9bf5a2-512x512.webp%3Fw%3D128%26h%3D128&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex-1"><div class="text-[18px] font-medium text-ivory">Sam Paderewski</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-[14px] text-ivory/60">Co-Founder, Structured finance and credit</div><div class="mt-3 flex gap-2"><a href="https://x.com/0x_roo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="X (Twitter) profile" class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ivory/10 text-ivory transition-colors hover:bg-yellow hover:text-charcoal"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path></svg></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sam-paderewski-17027129" target="_blank" rel="noopener